    "abstract": [
      {
        "source": "grobid_tei",
        "value": "Attribute-based encryption (ABE) enables fine-grained access control on encrypted data and has a large number of practical applications. This paper presents FABEO: faster pairing-based ciphertextpolicy and key-policy ABE schemes that support expressive policies and put no restriction on policy type or attributes, and the first to achieve optimal, adaptive security with multiple challenge ciphertexts. We implement our schemes and demonstrate that they perform better than the state-of-the-art ("
      },
      {
        "source": "pdfplumber",
        "value": "Attribute-based encryption (ABE) enables fine-grained access con- trol on encrypted data and has a large number of practical applica- tions. This paper presents FABEO: faster pairing-based ciphertext- policy and key-policy ABE schemes that support expressive policies and put no restriction on policy type or attributes, and the first to achieve optimal, adaptive security with multiple challenge ci- phertexts. We implement our schemes and demonstrate that they perform better than the state-of-the-art (Bethencourt et al. S&P all parameters of practical interest."
      },
